  days:
  - rules: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2cf159f00cd3ec1418cf23413ab9c478, type: 2}
    letterTitle: A letter from home
    letter: "Dear Dad,\nMom says the heater makes the funny noise again. Pip drew
      you a picture of the station, it is in the next parcel.\nWe miss you. Work
      hard and come home soon.\n\u2014 Lena"
    letterIfTrouble: 
    newToday: 'New today: no entry from ORVAN.'
    marketEvents: []
    barWish:
      tag: {fileID: 11400000, guid: df73a66dd95c513448baced3fe575726, type: 2}
      amount: 2
      sign: 
    bribe:
      traveler: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      note: 
  - rules: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 47b425f108c80aa4ab0cf080ce8cb42e, type: 2}
    letterTitle: A letter from home
    letter: "Dad,\nThe rent man came by and Mom paid him. They say the border is
      closed, so food costs more now. We are careful.\nPip asks if you can see us
      from up there.\n\u2014 Lena"
    letterIfTrouble: "Dad,\nThe rent man came by and Mom paid him, but one of us
      is not well and the border is closed, so everything costs more.\nPlease send
      what you can.\n\u2014 Lena"
    newToday: 'New today: Vellani travelers need a cargo manifest.'
    marketEvents:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: f43d7922bcf28184f9e158056a4dd645, type: 2}
    barWish:
      tag: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9e56bc2f97936a943a97d66ea4954de2, type: 2}
      amount: 1
      sign: 
    bribe:
      traveler: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      note: 
  - rules: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0da8243796883446a954f5e3f828cfb, type: 2}
    letterTitle: A letter from home
    letter: "Dad,\nIt got so cold last night that Pip slept in Mom's coat. The heater
      still works if you hit it.\nTell us about the people you meet.\n\u2014 Lena"
    letterIfTrouble: "Dad,\nIt got very cold and the house won't warm up. Being ill
      in this is hard. The clinic wants money first.\nMom won't say it, so I will:
      we need medicine.\n\u2014 Lena"
    newToday: 'New today: no stimulants, no antibiotics. Read the wanted list.'
    marketEvents:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 185c66fd5f1f3db4b9efbde0cf898138, type: 2}
    barWish:
      tag: {fileID: 11400000, guid: df73a66dd95c513448baced3fe575726, type: 2}
      amount: 0
      sign: 
    bribe:
      traveler: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7c29e7ebbcb24fd45ad901b18f3e4dab, type: 2}
      amount: 60
      note: 
  - rules: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fc723f802f59f0a49a2470832616437a, type: 2}
    letterTitle: A letter from home
    letter: "Dad,\nPip lost a tooth and wants you to have it. Mom said no. School
      is open again.\nWe counted. It is too many days until you are home.\n\u2014
      Lena"
    letterIfTrouble: "Dad,\nNobody sleeps much here now. Pip keeps asking when you
      are coming.\nI said soon. Please don't make me a liar.\n\u2014 Lena"
    newToday: 'New today: quarantine at KETRA STATION. Stimulants stay forbidden.'
    marketEvents: []
    barWish:
      tag: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 74c26e4bb62f1884ab816ec412ab79fc, type: 2}
      amount: 0
      sign: 
    bribe:
      traveler: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      note: 
  - rules: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9b0c3536f2c09a340b819fa261d5df06, type: 2}
    letterTitle: A letter from home
    letter: "Dad,\nA man from the housing office wrote down how many of us live here.
      Mom told him not to worry about it.\nPip learned to whistle. It is all Pip
      does now.\n\u2014 Lena"
    letterIfTrouble: "Dad,\nThe clinic has a list now and we are not near the top
      of it. Mom says the list is how they say no politely.\nDid the last parcel
      go out?\n\u2014 Lena"
    newToday: 'New today: spice is forbidden. ORVAN stays closed.'
    marketEvents: []
    barWish:
      tag: {fileID: 11400000, guid: df73a66dd95c513448baced3fe575726, type: 2}
      amount: 2
      sign: 
    bribe:
      traveler: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      note: 
  - rules: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 61d33bbba5a59064fafffd79e45018a2, type: 2}
    letterTitle: A letter from home
    letter: "Dad,\nThey showed the station on the news. Mom turned it off, then turned
      it back on to look for you.\nPip says hello. Well, Pip whistled.\n\u2014 Lena"
    letterIfTrouble: "Dad,\nWe traded the good chairs for what we needed. We sit
      on crates now, it is fine.\nIf you can send anything this week, please do.\n\u2014
      Lena"
    newToday: 'New today: Xirrik travelers need a cargo manifest. No stimulants.'
    marketEvents: []
    barWish:
      tag: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9e56bc2f97936a943a97d66ea4954de2, type: 2}
      amount: 0
      sign: 
    bribe:
      traveler: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      note: 
  - rules: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2099058142868124894c082d1b45bc78, type: 2}
    letterTitle: A letter from home
    letter: "Dad,\nI counted the money in the jar twice and it came out different,
      so I counted it a third time.\nMom says you will have enough for the ticket
      soon. Will you?\n\u2014 Lena"
    letterIfTrouble: "Dad,\nMom sold her coat. She says it was too warm anyway.\nPlease
      come home soon. I am not asking for anything else.\n\u2014 Lena"
    newToday: 'New today: Quobb travelers need a cargo manifest. Quarantine at KETRA
      STATION.'
    marketEvents: []
    barWish:
      tag: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b383f9fa0014ed44c9c87250378ff26d, type: 2}
      amount: 0
      sign: 
    bribe:
      traveler: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      note: 
  - rules: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ed1738225c8198049bf1c7ccf109b4ed, type: 2}
    letterTitle: A letter from home
    letter: "Dad,\nThere was a fight at the water line. Nobody we know. Mom keeps
      us in after dark now.\nPip drew the station again, with you in the window.\n\u2014
      Lena"
    letterIfTrouble: "Dad,\nThere was a fight at the water line and the shops are
      nearly empty. Everything takes longer now and nothing gets better.\nWrite to
      us, even a short one.\n\u2014 Lena"
    newToday: 'New today: no entry from HALDER, fusion cells are forbidden, Sorvak
      travelers need a cargo manifest.'
    marketEvents: []
    barWish:
      tag: {fileID: 11400000, guid: df73a66dd95c513448baced3fe575726, type: 2}
      amount: 0
      sign: 
    bribe:
      traveler: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      note: 
  - rules: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9e5c136bff2f39b419d6a5bf39482907, type: 2}
    letterTitle: A letter from home
    letter: "Dad,\nThey say inspectors are at your station. Mom says that means you
      must be good at your job or in trouble.\nI said both.\n\u2014 Lena"
    letterIfTrouble: "Dad,\nThe inspectors were on the news and all I could think
      about was the rent. Mom doesn't sleep. I do the counting now.\nPlease don't
      lose this job.\n\u2014 Lena"
    newToday: 'Inspection week: every rule applies at once. Read the bulletin.'
    marketEvents:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5abb6d2dd34a7184e83d89c7b9389401, type: 2}
    barWish:
      tag: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 74c26e4bb62f1884ab816ec412ab79fc, type: 2}
      amount: 0
      sign: 
    bribe:
      traveler: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      note: 
  - rules: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1b8831e4c33bca243bddc6a5cedf255b, type: 2}
    letterTitle: A letter from home
    letter: "Dad,\nI am taller than Mom now. She measured us on the door frame and
      then went quiet.\nThere is a mark there for you too, from before.\n\u2014 Lena"
    letterIfTrouble: "Dad,\nI stopped going to school so I can queue for things.
      Don't be angry. Somebody has to.\nHow many more days?\n\u2014 Lena"
    newToday: 'New today: weapons are forbidden. Xirrik travelers need a cargo manifest.'
    marketEvents: []
    barWish:
      tag: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9e56bc2f97936a943a97d66ea4954de2, type: 2}
      amount: 0
      sign: 
    bribe:
      traveler: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      note: 
  - rules: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f5668e3901dea3840b7868abff493fcb, type: 2}
    letterTitle: A letter from home
    letter: "Dad,\nThe heater stopped making the funny noise. It also stopped working,
      but Mom fixed it with a spoon.\nWe saved you the good bowl.\n\u2014 Lena"
    letterIfTrouble: "Dad,\nIt is very quiet here now. Mom says we should not count
      the days, so I count them where she can't see.\nPlease be careful up there.\n\u2014
      Lena"
    newToday: 'New today: quarantine at MERIDIAN GATE. ORVAN stays closed.'
    marketEvents: []
    barWish:
      tag: {fileID: 11400000, guid: df73a66dd95c513448baced3fe575726, type: 2}
      amount: 0
      sign: 
    bribe:
      traveler: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      note: 
  - rules: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e925253f1cab37941b49914be448475e, type: 2}
    letterTitle: A letter from home
    letter: "Dad,\nMom says the shuttle home leaves whenever you are ready. I told
      Pip it could be any day now.\nPip stopped whistling and sat by the window.\n\u2014
      Lena"
    letterIfTrouble: "Dad,\nI don't know how to write this one. Please just come
      home.\n\u2014 Lena"
    newToday: 'New today: human travelers need a cargo manifest. No cash shipments.'
    marketEvents: []
    barWish:
      tag: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      sign: 
    bribe:
      traveler: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      note: 
  loop: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 442076ee6625ce5438551526caf39ee5, type: 2}
